Running in local archive mode — I can answer questions about Innovation Inc, Pinewood Builders, the Thermal Power Plant, and this workstation from my built-in knowledge base.
Add an OpenAI API key to the workstation config to unlock the full neural core for general knowledge and real-time responses.

Tip: try 'topics' or 'help' to see what I can do.`,hx=`AURA v2.0 — Advanced Unified Research Assistant
